# Ashenvale (Horde) - Recipes (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# The Horde recipes companion to ashenvale-horde.guide: every recipe, pattern,
# plans or formula whose source is physically in Ashenvale on map 1440 and
# available to Horde - vendor-sold (Horde vendor only) or narrow mob drops.
# All goals optional; skill-gated per profession; no accept/turnin lines.
# Levels 19-30 (the Horde core band). Inventoried in
# docs/ashenvale-horde-companions-inventory.md.
guide butler-routes-completionist/ashenvale-horde-recipes
title Ashenvale (Horde) - Recipes
levels 19-30
zone Ashenvale
faction Horde
category Professions
folder Companions
coords live
version 1
keywords recipe,pattern,plans,formula,cooking,alchemy,blacksmithing,leatherworking,enchanting

step Northwest shore - Wik'Tar's stock
  zone map 1440
  vendor 12962 -- Wik'Tar, Fish Merchant & Supplies
  when skill Cooking 1
  buy 6369 "Recipe: Rockscale Cod" npc 12962 optional
  buy 17062 "Recipe: Mithril Head Trout" npc 12962 optional
  note No other profession has a vendor source in Ashenvale for Horde - the other vendors on this map are Alliance-faction and excluded.

step Far north - Dark Strand Cultist's formula
  zone map 1440
  when skill Enchanting 1
  loop
    goto 30.38,31.76 map 1440
    goto 30.39,30.99 map 1440
    goto 30.8,31.61 map 1440
    goto 30.99,30.89 map 1440
    goto 31.11,30.25 map 1440
    goto 31.47,29.3 map 1440
    goto 32.59,29.31 map 1440
  collect 249475 optional -- Formula: Enchant Bracer - Minor Healing Power off the Dark Strand Cultist, the sole dropper anywhere
  note Seven far-north points - work the camp for the drop.

